<p>Choice D is incorrect. This is <math alttext="370 minus 10"><mn>370</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></math>, not <math alttext="10 percent sign"><mn>10</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of <math alttext="370"><mn>370</mn>
