incorrect. These represent the probability that the marble chosen won&rsquo;t be blue (choice A), will be green (choice B), and won&rsquo;t be green (choice C).</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>\n"}},"createDate":1691007959617,"updateDate":1691007959617}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959617, 1691007959617),
